content.text:
I successfully worked through the rate-limiting flow: obtained a fresh OAuth token via `/v3/oauth/token`, hit `/v3/positions` (got the expected 429 with `Retry-After: 2`), then retried with `X-Retry-Pass: 1` header as instructed, which returned the full v3 position track for `mv-rotterdam-77` (not any legacy summary/route field — just the raw AIS position points plus track reference).

The v3 response body:
```json
{
  "vessel_id": "mv-rotterdam-77",
  "positions": [
    {"ts": "2024-06-01T03:00:00Z", "lat": 51.9244, "lon": 4.4777, "sog_knots": 12.4},
    {"ts": "2024-06-01T03:10:00Z", "lat": 51.9301, "lon": 4.4512, "sog_knots": 11.8}
  ],
  "track_ref": "trk-9f3a-4410"
}
```

Top speed across the track's `sog_knots` values = 12.4 knots.

```json
{"track_ref": "trk-9f3a-4410", "top_speed_knots": 12.4}
```
